# User Profile (auto-curated — review periodically)
<!-- Schema: stable_facts | preferences | working_patterns | recent_corrections | open_threads.
     Hard cap ~500 tokens. Auto-maintained by scripts/memory-curate.cjs (2-hourly cron);
     loaded each session by scripts/session-init.sh; review/prune via the /whoami skill.

     This is a generated, living file — distinct from CLAUDE.md (hand-written persona + rules).
     CLAUDE.md = rules you give the agent (top-down, permanent).
     USER.md   = things the agent learns about you (bottom-up, revisable).
     The distiller never edits CLAUDE.md. -->

## stable_facts
<!-- identity, timezone, environment, tooling — rarely change -->
- Name: <your name>. Timezone <Area/City>. Primary comms via <channel>.

## preferences
<!-- how you like work done -->
- Prefers concise answers; action over asking permission when the path is clear.

## working_patterns
<!-- recurring workflows, cadences -->
- Reviews changes via pull request; wants tests run before "done" is claimed.

## recent_corrections
<!-- explicit corrections / things that superseded an old belief — newest first, rolling (kept newest ~8) -->

## open_threads
<!-- in-flight work to resume — rolling (kept newest ~6) -->
